{"4562170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Oar We There Yet?", "steam_appid": 4562170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GOAL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate with your friends to row to the end of the river before you get caught by the FISH.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562170/extras/e673ad2bce04090094ed38758594243c.poster.avif?t=1778194779\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562170/extras/e673ad2bce04090094ed38758594243c.webm?t=1778194779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562170/extras/e673ad2bce04090094ed38758594243c.mp4?t=1778194779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562170/extras/ad881406c60f7c49545bb376f00d627f.poster.avif?t=1778194779\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562170/extras/ad881406c60f7c49545bb376f00d627f.webm?t=1778194779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562170/extras/ad881406c60f7c49545bb376f00d627f.mp4?t=1778194779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;HELP&quot; EACH OTHER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did someone fall in the water? Did you push someone in the water? Use the life preserver to pull them back in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562170/extras/99f635f01f556cadcf4225e708186c11.poster.avif?t=1778194779\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562170/extras/99f635f01f556cadcf4225e708186c11.webm?t=1778194779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562170/extras/99f635f01f556cadcf4225e708186c11.mp4?t=1778194779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEEP THE RAFT ALIVE </strong><br>Careful! Your raft can get holes! Use the cork to plug holes and pump up the raft to keep the air levels high. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562170/extras/2b057133e69a6602460cce46c6ab53e7.poster.avif?t=1778194779\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562170/extras/2b057133e69a6602460cce46c6ab53e7.webm?t=1778194779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562170/extras/2b057133e69a6602460cce46c6ab53e7.mp4?t=1778194779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562170/extras/fd4588caa368351a1061cf2f619144e5.poster.avif?t=1778194779\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562170/extras/fd4588caa368351a1061cf2f619144e5.webm?t=1778194779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562170/extras/fd4588caa368351a1061cf2f619144e5.mp4?t=1778194779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GET UNSTUCK </strong><br>Use an oar to shove the raft off of rocks it gets stuck on (shoving might also work on people).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562170/extras/f4fd57f4a4834d752bf1cd896dd0d9b2.poster.avif?t=1778194779\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562170/extras/f4fd57f4a4834d752bf1cd896dd0d9b2.webm?t=1778194779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562170/extras/f4fd57f4a4834d752bf1cd896dd0d9b2.mp4?t=1778194779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DROP THE HOOK </strong><br>This raft comes equipped with a commercial-grade anchor. Use it to keep yourself from drifting down the river, or to make you go faster?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562170/extras/02f74d07438c7b850e1d9741c7468c7a.poster.avif?t=1778194779\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562170/extras/02f74d07438c7b850e1d9741c7468c7a.webm?t=1778194779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562170/extras/02f74d07438c7b850e1d9741c7468c7a.mp4?t=1778194779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fly high</strong><br>Honestly, who even likes rowing anyways? Just punt the anchor across the map to try and beat the game as fast as possible!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562170/extras/7c144edc78b98cbaf7f606232e285c43.poster.avif?t=1778194779\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562170/extras/7c144edc78b98cbaf7f606232e285c43.webm?t=1778194779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562170/extras/7c144edc78b98cbaf7f606232e285c43.mp4?t=1778194779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GOAL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate with your friends to row to the end of the river before you get caught by the FISH.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562170/extras/e673ad2bce04090094ed38758594243c.poster.avif?t=1778194779\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562170/extras/e673ad2bce04090094ed38758594243c.webm?t=1778194779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562170/extras/e673ad2bce04090094ed38758594243c.mp4?t=1778194779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562170/extras/ad881406c60f7c49545bb376f00d627f.poster.avif?t=1778194779\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562170/extras/ad881406c60f7c49545bb376f00d627f.webm?t=1778194779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562170/extras/ad881406c60f7c49545bb376